Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:10.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's getting real hot out here. \NI'll do one more song and call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:13.05,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:15.20,Main,GIRL A,0,0,0,,I want AKP48!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.11,0:00:24.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The crowd's clearly gotten \Nbigger after sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:27.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's a real chance that she'll beat \Nyours truly in terms of popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.93,0:00:28.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.72,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Ever since I met you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:31.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,she's no closer to putting on \Na street performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:34.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is she actually writing any songs?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:35.08,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My heart's been pounding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:35.39,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.08,0:00:37.83,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And it just won't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:38.18,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who's that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:41.39,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's kind of bothering me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:44.40,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Good mornings, bye-byes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:47.69,Main,GIRL A,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:48.77,Main,GIRL B,0,0,0,,Forgot her lyrics?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:50.51,Main,GIRL C,0,0,0,,Probably broke a guitar string.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.15,0:00:56.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry, that's all for today. \NSee you next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.29,0:00:58.79,Main,CROWD,0,0,0,,Aww...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:02.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Can I talk to you for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.93,0:01:15.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hello? Can you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.61,0:01:21.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:27.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm Yamabuki, and you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.03,0:01:36.06,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'm sorry for \Nignoring you! So don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.06,0:01:37.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm glad you can see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.79,0:01:41.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I was afraid I'd died and become a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.17,0:01:42.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why did you ignore me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.16,0:01:44.17,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Because you seemed annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:48.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rest assured, for I am anything but. \NIn fact, allow me to list ten reasons why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.13,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,S-So you are annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:54.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I just wanted to ask you why \Nyou seemed so put off back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:56.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is there something you didn't like \Nabout Inohana's show?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:58.43,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:01:59.88,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,About her show, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:01.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I think she's doing pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She has her finger on the pulse \Nof what songs are popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:08.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and she's good at copying \Nthe originals' singing styles.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:10.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But... she does seem \Nto get self-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.59,0:02:11.57,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,You know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:15.36,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,It's the songs that are popular, not her. \NAnybody else could cover them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:19.24,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,She wasn't like this before...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:22.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you a friend of hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:24.61,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:26.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:29.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let me ask you a couple more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:31.67,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,How are you so fast? That's freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.18,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}KARAOKE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:39.48,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I need to work on my original songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.80,0:02:38.80,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}LYRICS 1 FOR CONCERTS - NEW SONGS - LYRICS 2 FOR CONCERTS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.06,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NEW SONGS
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:43.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}KARAOKE HOUSE
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.35,0:02:43.56,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SCORING MODE EX\NLOADING!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:56.07,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Maybe I should actually tell Yamabuki-kun \Nthat this might be too hard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.10,0:02:59.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've brought your melon soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:02.49,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? I didn't order that, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What, you don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:06.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.54,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,How did you know I'd be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:15.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your old friend told me. \NI actually know her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.84,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You know Aiko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:19.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, so her name is Aiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.61,0:03:22.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She was quite the handful. \NShe wouldn't even give me her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.10,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I took his bait...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:27.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She looked really bored \Nas she watched your show,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.34,0:03:28.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,so I had a little chat with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:30.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.45,0:03:35.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your expression tells me \Nyou already have a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.88,0:03:37.36,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:41.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Aiko hates me for only doing \Ncovers of popular songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:45.25,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Because she loved the songs I wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:47.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Then just perform \Noriginal songs at your shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.83,0:03:48.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Don't wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:49.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why not...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.41,0:03:54.09,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you. \NIt's something I'm embarrassed about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:58.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But that's a problem. \NI have a duty to turn you into a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What must I do to get you to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:04.01,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This is a karaoke room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.35,0:04:05.86,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You gotta sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:07.94,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Karaoke battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.56,0:04:07.94,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SCORING MODE EX
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll tell you if you do better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:15.10,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Singing battle versus an aspiring singer? \NYou really don't intend to tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.10,0:04:17.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I accept your challenge, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.78,Main,RIKKO,0,0,0,,I'll go first, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.91,0:04:21.87,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I demand a handicap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:24.03,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You'll sing a song that I pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.48,0:04:28.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's one you sang in your show yesterday. \NNo objections there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:29.95,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:32.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,However, you also have to do the dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.22,0:04:33.10,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.55,0:04:38.55,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}LOVE YOU!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:38.55,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Like I said, it's a handicap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Go on. It's about to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:44.86,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.07,0:04:52.30,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Ever since I met you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:55.35,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My heart's been pounding
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.84,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And it just won't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:58.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Victory is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:01.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I thought so during your show, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.79,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You get self-conscious and give off that \N"I only do this because I have to" vibe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.79,0:05:09.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,hoping we'll read through your lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:14.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That defensive behavior must \Nbe what angered your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.65,0:05:34.03,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,Ever since I met you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:37.09,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,My heart's been pounding
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.09,0:05:39.36,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,And it just won't stop
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:42.61,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's kind of bothering me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:45.39,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,Good mornings, bye-byes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:48.13,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,And even the mundane nights
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.45,0:05:53.14,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,Make me think of you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:56.46,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,I wanna say \N"You've grown a little taller"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.46,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,"We use the same notebook"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:03.98,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,"Thank you for the other day" and more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:10.93,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,But I still can't bring myself to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.69,0:06:19.17,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whenever I hear your voice, \Nmy vision gets all sparkly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:24.09,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,I can't seem to get you off my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:29.74,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's something \NI wanna tell you eye-to-eye
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.78,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Th-This girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:29.24,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's way fiercer than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.74,0:06:33.88,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's how I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:35.75,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:37.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.18,0:06:42.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,S-So how exactly am\NI self-conscious, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.87,Main,STAFF,0,0,0,,I've brought your hot tea with honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.75,Main,STAFF,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for interrupting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:57.94,Main - Top,EPTITLE A,0,0,0,,IT'S HOT, SO PLEASE BE CAREFUL
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.86,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SCORE: 95.925 / NATIONAL AVERAGE: 84.836\NANALYSIS: YOU'RE AN AMAZING SINGER.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:32.03,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.03,0:08:33.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:34.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:36.45,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's do or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:38.59,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll bet it all on this song!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I hope you have your medicine ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:44.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly has a beautiful voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.17,0:08:46.21,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It might intoxicate you, so watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.22,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}A BUS WON'T TAKE US TO THE MOON
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:57.85,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}A BUS WON'T TAKE US TO THE MOON
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:07.12,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm not a special person
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:10.38,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:11.41,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I thought so when we did \Nthat show together in the spring,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:16.07,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's why, whenever we talk
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.78,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and it's the same now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:17.16,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,He's not that good at singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.07,0:09:20.96,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,I give you the cold shoulder
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:20.33,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But... This song...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:24.00,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}SCORE: 75.129 / NATIONAL AVERAGE: 82.172\NANALYSIS: YOUR VIBRATO SOUNDS LIKE A DOG WITH A CRUSHED THROAT, BRO.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The machine has to be malfunctioning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This score's unacceptable for a Yamabuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:30.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,A 20-point gap, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:33.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,W-Wait! 20 points is \Nbasically the margin of error!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.50,0:09:35.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why did you sing that song?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:41.20,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, can I ask you one last thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.23,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:44.55,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,The band logo on your shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.55,0:09:45.56,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you like that band?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.56,0:09:48.86,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, this? Yeah, I like 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.14,0:09:51.24,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,It's the band Rikka loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:54.54,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Listen, Arisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.54,0:09:56.61,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I found this amazing band!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.61,0:09:59.91,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,They're not that well-known, \Nbut they're called...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.91,0:10:03.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hugg Notes? I loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:05.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A certain someone recommended them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:10.01,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:13.92,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why \NI don't sing original songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:15.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you sure? I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:18.96,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I said whoever does better wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.96,0:10:23.09,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The scores don't matter. \NYour song was better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:27.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.61,0:10:29.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Man, you really hate losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.45,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Stuff happened in my past,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:36.70,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and now I can't sing my \Noriginal songs in front of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:38.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:44.75,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Of the looks people give me when \Nthey judge me or think I'm a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:49.38,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Covers are much easier because I can \Nhide behind other people's music.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:51.84,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,How cowardly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:56.37,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. She's scared of the \Naudience's judgmental eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:11:00.45,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,A straightforward trauma, \Nand a critical one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.89,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,If it's not resolved at once, \Nshe has no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.15,0:11:05.82,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I've been trying to write a new song,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:09.01,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but remembering those eyes \Nstops me dead in my tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.01,0:11:11.47,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's affecting her songwriting, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.47,0:11:13.55,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:17.41,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Right. We'll just have to \Ndo this the Yamabuki way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.41,0:11:19.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're scared of having eyes on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:22.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I used to be that way, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You know that's my tea, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:27.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I had to take part in numerous \Nextracurricular activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:31.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Presentations and speeches \Nwere part of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:35.46,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The piercing gaze of the audience \Nis something I know all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.12,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,How did you get over your fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Even if you can't write a new song,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:43.81,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,you still have your old ones, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.81,0:11:46.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.21,0:11:48.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Then it's clear what we must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:52.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We'll do an "Inohana Rikka \NOriginal Songs School Concert."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:53.11,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wha?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:57.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You just have to get used to it. \NExperience is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll arrange a venue \Nand an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:00.85,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Don't decide for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:05.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It doesn't have to be a new song, \Nbut you can only perform your own songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.59,0:12:08.21,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're being \Na bit insensitive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:12.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is normal for the Yamabuki family. \NEven you should be able to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.37,0:12:15.54,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:18.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Excellent. Now, as for when...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:20.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We'll do the concert a week from now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:30.06,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The school rooftop? \NWhy not my usual spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.34,0:12:35.34,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I thought you'd understand how I feel, \Nbut I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:41.63,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,In the end, you're not mediocre like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:44.95,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Are you the same as that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:47.70,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:49.80,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Maybe I expected too much of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.92,0:13:07.52,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yamabuki-kun. \NI really don't think I can...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, you're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.58,0:13:11.08,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Rooftop scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.69,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We get to hear your original song \Nafter so long, Rikka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.73,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:19.36,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Why are you all here? \NWhere are the other spectators?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.36,0:13:21.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's just the four of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did you really think \NI'd throw you to the wolves?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:25.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,In order to get used to \Nthe audience's gaze,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:27.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,you start with friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.94,0:13:32.88,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You should've just told us \Nif we could help you overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:35.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We'll watch you \Nwith the clearest of eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.13,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We get VIP seats! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:44.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Relax. I've locked the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.18,0:13:48.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You have nothing but allies here. \NShake your fear and sing for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.39,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FURIN HIGH SCHOOL
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:54.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:58.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's been ages since I last played \Nmy songs for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well, damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.40,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I don't even know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:06.79,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did I wrongly assume that she'd be \Nable to do it in front of friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.79,0:14:10.79,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,It seems her trauma is quite \Ndeep-rooted. What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:12.28,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.34,Main,NENEIKO,0,0,0,,Rikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.34,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Rikka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:22.67,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RIKKA FTW - WE STAN INOHANA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.97,0:14:20.37,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You always put up a front \Nand never tell us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.37,0:14:22.67,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You should at least vent to us sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.67,0:14:27.55,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RIKKA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.93,0:14:27.55,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We kinda made these sloppy last-minute, \Nbut we'll do better when it's for reals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.81,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}RIKKA LOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:31.81,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Imagine we're always in the front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.10,0:14:35.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Just look at us when it gets tough, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:42.07,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:54.62,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You're going to be a singer, Rikka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:57.81,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Will you take the stage \Nat the Tokyo Dome someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:15:01.01,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,I wanna see you sing in a huge venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:03.29,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,As we looked up the open blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:04.52,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,Pull some strings \Nand get us front-row seats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.29,0:15:06.56,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,In bright white letters
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.52,0:15:07.95,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,That'd be great! \NClose enough to see your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:11.04,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We wrote about our purpose, \Nwe wrote about our future
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:12.59,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Right... I'd made a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:14.41,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And painted it with your dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.48,0:15:17.03,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That I'd get them front-row \Nseats to my concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.77,0:15:20.04,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With each passing "See you tomorrow"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.98,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Our hearts grew closer
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:30.41,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I can't believe you tricked me. \NWay to destroy my trust in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:34.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,S-Sorry. I figured you wouldn't be \Nnervous if I told you in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.41,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Apology rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.41,0:15:38.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How can I redeem myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.13,0:15:43.18,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Treat me to karaoke and help me practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:45.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If that'll repair your trust, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:48.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,One time probably isn't enough, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:50.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did my credit score go down that much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:53.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wh-What's it at right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:58.87,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If it was at 100 before, \Nit's around 80 now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It fell 20 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:03.94,Main,EPTITLE B SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}20 POINTS IS BASICALLY THE MARGIN OF ERROR
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.31,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,In the middle of outer space
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:12.58,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We seize our very own reason \Nthat we can only find here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:14.59,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It starts running and running
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:15.94,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,That song, which she probably \Nwrote a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:19.38,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Becoming a nameless warmth in our hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.61,0:16:20.37,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,was rough around the edges \Nbut very Inohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:24.59,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And our world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:26.56,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,And it definitely touched hearts, \Neven if crying was a bit over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:32.41,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I have no idea why she locked \Nthat talent away,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:37.63,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but she's taken a step forward \Nthanks to her clubmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:46.90,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I thought I could guide them myself, \Nbut that was hubris on yours truly's part.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:51.12,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,When they run into adversity one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:54.42,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,it probably won't be me \Nwho helps them overcome it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.95,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but rather the bonds between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:04.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,With that in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:09.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,why don't you four hang out and have \Nfun together to bolster your solidarity?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:10.66,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why the shopping mall?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:12.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,My little sister loves this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.51,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Do you want to buy something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:15.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I want to get sneakers \Nfor my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:18.39,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Why'd you pick somewhere so far away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:21.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This place has good parfaits, \Nor so my little sister said.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.42,0:17:22.90,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Sis this, Sis that! Come with her, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:26.05,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We haven't been hanging out \Na lot lately, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.05,0:17:28.70,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Prepping for sports day \Nkept us all busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.74,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I want to get some new clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Feel free to have fun however. \NPay no mind to yours errand boy truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:35.93,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I don't care about you by default.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.46,0:17:39.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I told you to have some fun together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Errand Boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.38,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If you're free, help me pick out clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't mind, but wouldn't it be better \Nto ask the girls instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.91,0:17:49.17,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:51.39,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I've put on weight lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.39,0:17:54.04,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I don't want them to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:56.26,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But it's okay if I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:58.35,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:17:59.70,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.26,0:18:04.85,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:06.89,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:09.78,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Is this a bit too showy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:14.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Balanced, but less isn't always more. \NSeventy-eight points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.63,0:18:17.20,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to \Ntry this hard to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:18.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,you've only tried on white clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.22,0:18:21.96,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Because I like white.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:25.70,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a white outfit right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:27.04,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I like white, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:31.01,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \NApollo said something similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:35.20,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I keep seeing traces of Apollo \Nin these girls every now and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:36.93,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but I still lack conclusive proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.50,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,A lot of people like the color white...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:40.60,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,So, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:45.52,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Does your silence mean \Nthat you like this showy outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.07,0:18:47.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,As if!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.36,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's the best one so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.87,0:18:51.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You look very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:51.94,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Cu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:56.32,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I-I didn't ask you to go into \Nthat much detail...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:02.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, where did the other three go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:05.99,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bucky! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:09.63,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's an emergency! \NCome with me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:14.72,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's stuck in the chute! \NAfter I spent 1,000 yen, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.63,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,And you want me to get it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.63,0:19:18.93,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Please. I want it bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.93,0:19:22.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly is adept with crane games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:23.77,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:29.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The claw is set to have \Na weak grip strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.25,0:19:33.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So instead of using it to grab, \Nyou use it for pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.71,0:19:38.43,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Stop! The stuffing's gonna come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.43,0:19:40.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly is also adept at sewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.58,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want it undamaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:45.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's yours truly for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:46.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.34,0:19:52.38,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Putting my scent on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.38,0:19:54.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I don't want it to smell unfamiliar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.24,0:19:58.46,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,When I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.46,0:20:02.24,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep without a plushie \Nthat had my scent on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:04.83,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now she's sounding like her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:05.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey, is that habit—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.98,0:20:09.19,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Oh, you can go now, Bucky. \NThanks for the help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:11.44,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.44,0:20:13.44,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,They're all just doing their own thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:15.78,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's no point if they \Ndon't hang out together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:18.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hey, errand boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:22.28,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Want some takoyaki? I ordered too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.77,0:20:26.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've told you not to call me \Nan errand boy loudly in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.63,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What's the problem? \NIf I don't call you that, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.63,0:20:29.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:33.28,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Then nothing. Come on, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:36.30,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Mentai mayo is the best way \Nto eat takoyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.67,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,I always order that flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:40.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let me ask you one thing. \NWhat flavor did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.74,0:20:42.78,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh? Salt and green onions, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:44.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:45.60,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I got mentai mayo, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:46.90,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You did?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:50.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you? \NDo you like mentai mayo that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:52.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.79,0:20:55.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sorry, can I get a toothpick?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:56.89,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:59.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Say aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:01.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why are you feeding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.24,0:21:05.15,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What else am I supposed to do? \NWe only have this one toothpick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.92,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Well? Does it feel good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:16.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"Feel good"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:18.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You mean "taste good."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:21.05,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It must feel good \Nto be fed by a ten like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.43,0:21:26.14,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, do you know where Inohana is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.38,0:21:30.17,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Says she's watching ducks by the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.17,0:21:32.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Why'd she leave the mall?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:34.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll go drag her back! \NThank you for the takoyaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:39.25,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You could've acted \Na bit more flustered, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:42.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What was even the point \Nof teasing you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:48.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I said to have fun together, \Nbut since you refuse to do as I say,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.16,0:21:50.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I say we need a change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.96,0:21:52.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We're doing karaoke instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.67,0:21:53.93,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,So loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:55.41,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,The lighting's so lewd.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:57.79,Main - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This place has great honey tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:00.38,Main - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now you'll have no choice \Nbut to deepen your bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:02.52,Main - Top,NENE,0,0,0,,They've always been deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:03.68,Main - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.68,0:22:05.81,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We're back at karaoke again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.81,0:22:08.77,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy our little \Nkaraoke date that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.31,0:22:11.58,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Player.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.81,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Gigolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.81,0:22:14.26,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Manwhore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:16.11,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I did nothing to warrant such slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:18.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll go first, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.57,0:22:20.15,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,What will you sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.15,0:22:24.04,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I liked it when you sang this \Nthe other day, so this is payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:30.62,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}A BUS WON'T TAKE US TO THE MOON
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.59,0:22:32.99,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, this song?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:36.65,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Listen, Arisu! I found this amazing band!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:44.14,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm not a special person
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.82,0:22:44.14,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Liking the same color \Nand flavor is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.14,0:22:48.21,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,but can you just happen to like the same \Nniche band that broke up years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.70,0:22:47.39,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.21,0:22:52.93,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's why, whenever we talk
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:52.20,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of message?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:56.00,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Inohana, are you actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:57.95,Italics - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I give you the cold shoulder
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.83,0:23:03.15,Italics - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,And now I don't know if that's okay
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:01.08,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.62,0:23:03.15,Italics - Top,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If that's okay
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.18,0:23:03.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:05.85,Italics - Top,ALL,0,0,0,,And now I'm worried
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.85,0:23:07.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa! Pause!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.41,0:23:11.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You all know this band?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.59,0:23:13.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.31,0:23:15.16,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We all love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.62,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We've even played their songs \Nduring lunchtime broadcasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:18.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But they're such a niche band!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:21.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Someone brought an album to school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.17,0:23:22.80,Main,CREDITS SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(938,684)\fntimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HBC6F5D&\blur4\bord2\shad0\pos(445,219)}Translation:\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\hTiming:\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\hEditing:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.17,0:23:22.80,Main,CREDITS SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(938,684)\fntimes New Roman\fs14\3c&HBC6F5D&\bord2\shad0\blur4\pos(534,219)}\h\hSriram Gurunathan\NMariana Martinez\NWilliam Haggard\h
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.42,0:23:23.09,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wh-Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.09,0:23:24.44,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Who brought that CD?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.49,0:23:27.68,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.11,0:23:32.06,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,That reminds me! \NApollo could be rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:32.06,Main,CREDITS SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(815,566)\fntimes New Roman\\fs12\3c&HBC6F5D&\blur4\bord2\shad0\pos(470,274)}\h\h\h\h\hQuality Check:\NTranslation Check:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:32.06,Main,CREDITS SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(815,566)\fntimes New Roman\fs12\3c&HBC6F5D&\\blur4\bord2\shad0\pos(565,274)}S Bilyeu\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\NMichelle Tymon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.06,0:23:35.46,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Huh? How'd I learn about this band?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.46,0:23:37.02,Broadcast Flashback,APOLLO,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.02,Main,EPTITLE C SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FORGETFUL
